cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ThetaIDE: a desktop IDE for neuro-symbolic reinforcement learning"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/fixmeseb/Theta-IDE"
abstract: >-
  ThetaIDE is a PyQt6 desktop IDE for the NeSyRL neuro-symbolic reinforcement
  learning framework. It composes experiments from Hydra configuration, runs
  them across four learning paradigms, monitors training live, and assembles
  publication figures. Algorithms, models, environments, data modules,
  evaluators and plotters are installable components rather than built-in code.
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - neuro-symbolic
  - IDE
  - PyQt6
  - experiment management
